## §行动项 (Action Items)

> 决议触发后,§行动项 列出后续 OpenSpec change + 估时 + 优先级。

- [ ] (Pass 决议) 跳过 C5/C6,Wave 3 (execution-dsl) 启动周 ship
- [ ] (Fail 决议) 触发 ADR-0072 D2 `$var` 实施 (C5, 8h P0*, 必须先于 Wave 3)
- [ ] (Conditional 决议) 触发 ADR-0072 D3 declarative style (C6, 4h P0*)
- [ ] (Abort 决议) 重新测量 baseline, 由真实 3 模型替换 mock (Sprint 25+)

