## §决议 (Verdict)

**Decision**: `<Pass | Fail | Conditional | Abort>`

| Input | Value | ADR-0074 §决策 D4 threshold | Result |
|-------|-------|---------------------------|--------|
| parse_valid | `<value>` | ≥ 0.85 | <Pass/Conditional/Fail> |
| task_success L1 | `<value>` | ≥ 0.70 | (informational; not gating v1) |
| task_success L2 | `<value>` | ≥ 0.50 | (informational; not gating v1) |
| task_success L3 | `<value>` | ≥ 0.30 | (informational; not gating v1) |
| Prompt prefix tokens | `<value>` | ≤ 8000 | (deferred to Sprint 28+) |
| Few-shot coverage | `<%>` | 100% (≥ 32) | (deferred) |
| Golden suite | `<count>` | ≥ 50 | ✅ 51 |
| Failure events | `<topics>` | 2 topics | (deferred to ADR-0068 amendment) |

> **📋 8-condition Go check (ADR-0074 D-4)**: 当前 evaluate_gate v1 仅主决策在 parse_valid; L1/L2/L3 及 4 个附加条件 (tokens, coverage, golden, failure events) 留 v2 amendment (Sprint 25+)。本 v1 决议依据为 parse_valid 单维度 + 数据完整性 check。

